Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 18:30:12 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1415/1463] HERESY 1462: stems in six beside four (guitar and
 piano apart), six in the chain, the tree's word for them
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 15.10.2026: «BS-RoFormer-SW на 6 стемов — только ЗА. У нас сейчас 4 стема на выходе». «Split: six stems» after four, its models in its tip (ep317 for the voice, jarredou's BS-Roformer-SW on the instrumental, about 5 minutes for 7 on a 3090, measured 122 s for 164 s); the chain offers four, six and vocals; the tree says six stems and estimates its time. The Remaster mixes them as they are (the Debunker knows guitar and keyboard). Kitchen suite 822/0 (one new check).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
